      "cooked": "<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/8/8d9c0856a99a036da7a885f5c34f8f293e8c8c2e.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/8d9c0856a99a036da7a885f5c34f8f293e8c8c2e\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/8/8d9c0856a99a036da7a885f5c34f8f293e8c8c2e_2_231x500.jpeg\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"kcJCxlp23GvNYl37EKChIz3CTSu\" width=\"231\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/8/8d9c0856a99a036da7a885f5c34f8f293e8c8c2e_2_231x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/8/8d9c0856a99a036da7a885f5c34f8f293e8c8c2e_2_346x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/8/8d9c0856a99a036da7a885f5c34f8f293e8c8c2e_2_462x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/8/8d9c0856a99a036da7a885f5c34f8f293e8c8c2e_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1170×2532 196 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>\n<p>I ran straight into that danger zone like Wile E. Coyote running into a painted wall!</p>\n<p>Thought I would be all clever, saving a helpful card for Tachyon to play later, but boy did I feel silly real quick! At least Mister Fixer was able to fall in love with Tachyon, so he could spread a good hefty helping of emotional damage to the villain team!</p>",
