      "created_at": "2023-01-11T02:36:42.267Z",
      "cooked": "<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/d/d30b06ef37b4b94529b3703bd476e12237495a8e.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/d30b06ef37b4b94529b3703bd476e12237495a8e\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/d/d30b06ef37b4b94529b3703bd476e12237495a8e_2_231x500.jpeg\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"u6Yn2MoXHZrdhLNihrGe8j4G5oq\" width=\"231\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/d/d30b06ef37b4b94529b3703bd476e12237495a8e_2_231x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/d/d30b06ef37b4b94529b3703bd476e12237495a8e_2_346x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/d/d30b06ef37b4b94529b3703bd476e12237495a8e_2_462x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/d/d30b06ef37b4b94529b3703bd476e12237495a8e_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">828×1792 115 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>\n<p>Lots of punching on my side and lots of Hypersonic Assaults and Grease Guns for the enemy team. Very disappointing to see props being used for all the good damage cards out there, but luckily there’s no shortage of damage cards to use.</p>",
