      "created_at": "2023-01-12T21:00:42.716Z",
      "cooked": "<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/5/52836935dac29668f8acd6586971c9e48a2799dd.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/52836935dac29668f8acd6586971c9e48a2799dd\" title=\"Screenshot_20230110-013512\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/5/52836935dac29668f8acd6586971c9e48a2799dd_2_219x500.jpeg\" alt=\"Screenshot_20230110-013512\" data-base62-sha1=\"bLWHm6sPgYICvyk3HK0CFaZAfNj\" width=\"219\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/5/52836935dac29668f8acd6586971c9e48a2799dd_2_219x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/5/52836935dac29668f8acd6586971c9e48a2799dd_2_328x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/5/52836935dac29668f8acd6586971c9e48a2799dd_2_438x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/5/52836935dac29668f8acd6586971c9e48a2799dd_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screenshot_20230110-013512</span><span class=\"informations\">1080×2460 197 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>\n<p>A Hypersonic Assault or two and Grease Gun made sure the bad guys fell way behind in the damage race, and all three heroes made terrific use of their head start to defeat their nemeses handily!</p>",
