    {
      "id": 250324,
      "name": "",
      "username": "The_Justifier",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/the_justifier/{size}/4954_2.png",
      "created_at": "2023-01-12T22:31:55.578Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Vengeance Three is usually a lot harder than Vengeance Five, and these are all damage machines, so I was a little worried. But two Hypersonic Assaults made things very safe, and with a Jack Handle and two Charges, Fixer made short work of the enemy. Barely a single turn passed without Engine of Destruction adding an extra point to the pain Train was taking.  My only kind of hairy moment came when Fixer was hit for 6, because he Driving Mantised a Student of Many Masters to kill the Stolen Gear, not remembering what Iaijutsu Master does.  But this wasn’t even a Setback, just a slight annoyance; the mass beatdown continued under the supervision of Ray Manta and the Zorrm, and after Fixer took out FT and left the two women at 1, Friction played a Synergy Surge, killing her colleague and then herself!</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/0/015f5b495bab19e0bbe3a13759f959def001432e.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/015f5b495bab19e0bbe3a13759f959def001432e\" title=\"Screenshot_20230112-162401\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/0/015f5b495bab19e0bbe3a13759f959def001432e_2_225x500.jpeg\" alt=\"Screenshot_20230112-162401\" data-base62-sha1=\"c8MeHwWsT2uMqEjSfQy1n3p3m6\" width=\"225\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/0/015f5b495bab19e0bbe3a13759f959def001432e_2_225x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/0/015f5b495bab19e0bbe3a13759f959def001432e_2_337x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/0/015f5b495bab19e0bbe3a13759f959def001432e_2_450x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/0/015f5b495bab19e0bbe3a13759f959def001432e_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screenshot_20230112-162401</span><span class=\"informations\">720×1600 109 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>\n<p>Edit: seems like I have the highest combined health total so far, 39 compared to Doppelgangrun’s 35, Thunderbird’s 33, QuirkyDM’s 24, and poor Skywhale at 6.  Nobody actually lost though. Glad none of us tried to make some kind of dark, serious, modern kind of a film where Evil triumphs over Good or anything…</p>",
