      "cooked": "<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/e/ec89f530d62197e88b410250952ec2e21f0d5034.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/ec89f530d62197e88b410250952ec2e21f0d5034\" title=\"20230113220418_1\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/e/ec89f530d62197e88b410250952ec2e21f0d5034_2_345x194.jpeg\" alt=\"20230113220418_1\" data-base62-sha1=\"xKwfSPlQlH8PU4090n9btwiiSW0\" width=\"345\" height=\"194\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/e/ec89f530d62197e88b410250952ec2e21f0d5034_2_345x194.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/e/ec89f530d62197e88b410250952ec2e21f0d5034_2_517x291.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/e/ec89f530d62197e88b410250952ec2e21f0d5034_2_690x388.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/e/ec89f530d62197e88b410250952ec2e21f0d5034_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">20230113220418_1</span><span class=\"informations\">1920×1080 383 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>\n<p>I don’t normally enjoy team villain games but this one was a lot of fun, thanks to all of the area damage and damage prevention.</p>",
